    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Federated Learning for Cross-Modality Medical Image Segmentation via Augmentation-Driven Generalization
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Nagaraju%2C+S+D">Sachin Dudda Nagaraju</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Moradi%2C+A">Ashkan Moradi</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Abrahamsen%2C+B+S">Bendik Skarre Abrahamsen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Elschot%2C+M">Mattijs Elschot</a>
      
