    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Global-Local Dual Perception for MLLMs in High-Resolution Text-Rich Image Translation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lu%2C+J">Junxin Lu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Song%2C+T">Tengfei Song</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+Z">Zhanglin Wu</a>, 
      
