        BrepCoder: A Unified Multimodal Large Language Model for Multi-task B-rep Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kim%2C+M">Mingi Kim</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kim%2C+Y">Yongjun Kim</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kang%2C+J">Jungwoo Kang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kim%2C+H">Hyungki Kim</a>
      
