    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Humanizing Robot Gaze Shifts: A Framework for Natural Gaze Shifts in Humanoid Robots
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wei%2C+J">Jingchao Wei</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Qin%2C+J">Jingkai Qin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Cao%2C+Y">Yuxiao Cao</a>, 
      
