        SEF-MAP: Subspace-Decomposed Expert Fusion for Robust Multimodal HD Map Prediction
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fu%2C+H">Haoxiang Fu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+L">Lingfeng Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+H">Hao Li</a>, 
      
