        GatedCLIP: Gated Multimodal Fusion for Hateful Memes Detection
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Guo%2C+Y">Yingying Guo</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+K">Ke Zhang</a>, 
      
